2,-1.1484205722808838,-0.04833054542541504,-0.048398468643426895,-7.629365427419543e-06,-0.06979282945394516,-0.21860723197460175,-0.06635969877243042,-0.43367788195610046,-0.2252303957939148,-0.00013839241000823677,-0.005995029583573341,-1.4305104514278355e-06,-9.059865078597795e-06,-0.0007965967524796724,-0.004068906884640455,-2.3841855067985307e-07,0.0,-0.08942227810621262,-0.34277626872062683,-0.1441732943058014,-0.11820468306541443,-4.184158387943171e-05,-0.10021704435348511,-9.536738616588991e-07,-0.0002540027489885688,-1.8596476365928538e-05],"request":{"active_prefix":"","input_ids":[151644,8948,198,2610,525,1207,16948,11,3465,553,54364,14817,13,1446,525,264,10950,17847,13,151645,198,151644,872,198,50,3948,279,3491,3019,553,3019,13,20678,697,1590,4226,304,1124,79075,90,1112,92,382,32,1555,702,30232,400,30529,37018,90,22,15170,19,92,2418,220,15920,315,279,2701,22879,525,3204,5106,22879,369,279,1555,1939,58,6405,921,810,1722,445,309,3563,587,3071,25643,551,7,16,9961,626,12670,856,284,320,18,11,15,701,379,284,320,15,11,17,626,1502,31732,32,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,220,19,24984,220,22,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,379,317,1502,31732,33,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,220,22,24984,220,19,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,856,488,379,317,1502,31732,34,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,481,19,14,22,24984,220,16,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,220,17,18481,488,379,317,1502,31732,35,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,220,16,24984,220,22,14,19,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,220,18,18481,488,379,317,1502,31732,36,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,220,16,19,24984,481,23,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,320,15,11,15,1106,1502,31732,37,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,481,16,17,24984,220,17,16,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,856,317,1502,31732,38,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,481,17,24984,481,22,14,17,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,220,17,18481,317,1502,31732,39,8,57960,7265,90,5187,2555,92,481,16,14,18,24984,220,22,14,16,17,1124,408,90,5187,2555,31716,497,220,18,18481,317,24157,6405,2533,6269,279,11931,315,279,4396,2606,11,18663,553,76602,13,151645,198,151644,77091,198],"messages":[{"content":"Solve the problem step by step. Give your final answer in \\boxed{...}.\n\nA line has slope $-\\frac{7}{4}.$  Which of the following vectors are possible direction vectors for the line?\n\n[asy]\nusepackage(\"amsmath\");\n\nunitsize(1 cm);\n\npair x = (3,0), y = (0,2);\n\nlabel(\"(A) $\\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 7 \\end{pmatrix}$\", y);\nlabel(\"(B) $\\begin{pmatrix} 7 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix}$\", x + y);\nlabel(\"(C) $\\begin{pmatrix} -4/7 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$\", 2*x + y);\nlabel(\"(D) $\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 7/4 \\end{pmatrix}$\", 3*x + y);\nlabel(\"(E) $\\begin{pmatrix} 14 \\\\ -8 \\end{pmatrix}$\", (0,0));\nlabel(\"(F) $\\begin{pmatrix} -12 \\\\ 21 \\end{pmatrix}$\", x);\nlabel(\"(G) $\\begin{pmatrix} -2 \\\\ -7/2 \\end{pmatrix}$\", 2*x);\nlabel(\"(H) $\\begin{pmatrix} -1/3 \\\\ 7/12 \\end{pmatrix}$\", 3*x);\n[/asy]\n\nEnter the letters of the correct options, separated by commas.","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"20f5d0c1a204343230e3823f9ac963fcde14d1fdffca5dbb0fd56e2fb2aaca09"},"seconds":39.59032654762268,"seed":802828167891333771,"stop":"eos","text":"To determine which vectors could be direction vectors for a line with slope $-\\frac{7}{4}$, we must identify the vectors that have a slope equivalent to $-\\frac{7}{4}$ when the change in $y$ (the second coordinate) is divided by the change in $x$ (the first coordinate).\n\nThe slope of a vector $\\begin{pmatrix} x \\\\ y \\end{pmatrix}$ is given by $\\frac{y}{x}$. For the vector to be a direction vector of a line with slope $-\\frac{7}{4}$, the ratio $\\frac{y}{x}$ must equal $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n\nLet's test each vector:\n\n- For vector (A) $\\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 7 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{7}{4}$, which is not $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n- For vector (B) $\\begin{pmatrix} 7 \\\\ 4 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{4}{7}$, which is not $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n- For vector (C) $\\begin{pmatrix} -4/7 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{1}{-4/7} = -\\frac{7}{4}$, which matches the slope of the line.\n- For vector (D) $\\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 7/4 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{7/4}{1} = \\frac{7}{4}$, which is not $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n- For vector (E) $\\begin{pmatrix} 14 \\\\ -8 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{-8}{14} = -\\frac{4}{7}$, which is not $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n- For vector (F) $\\begin{pmatrix} -12 \\\\ 21 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{21}{-12} = -\\frac{7}{4}$, which matches the slope of the line.\n- For vector (G) $\\begin{pmatrix} -2 \\\\ -7/2 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{-7/2}{-2} = \\frac{7}{4}$, which is not $-\\frac{7}{4}$.\n- For vector (H) $\\begin{pmatrix} -1/3 \\\\ 7/12 \\end{pmatrix}$, the slope is $\\frac{7/12}{-1/3} = -\\frac{7}{4}$, which matches the slope of the line.\n\nTherefore, the vectors that could be direction vectors for the line are (C), (F), and (H).\n\n\\boxed{C,F,H}"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{C,F,H}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
